\n- [`4941015`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/4941015b27f984599df30fbffde0559348cc0482) feat: check individual specifier importKind in `no-shadow` ([#&#8203;21518](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21518)) (L\u00ea V\u0103n Xu\u00e2n Ho\u00e0n)\n- [`17f17cd`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/17f17cd7a248c532cfce61b7f915760608ca7121) feat: update error location to head for `default-case` ([#&#8203;21469](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21469)) (Tanuj Kanti)\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n- [`23ac66c`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/23ac66c0d929c2c8af82f1ceb5f20f5a1752bf03) fix: update dependency [@&#8203;eslint/config-array](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/config-array) to ^0.23.6 ([#&#8203;21550](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21550)) (renovate\\[bot])\n- [`df71e34`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/df71e34a8bfa084feb5c6423fbdd5ad807ea13b3) fix: skip `no-prototype-builtins` suggestion when object is `super` ([#&#8203;21535](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21535)) (KooYS)\n- [`899065e`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/899065e556c90ef72d96b2228182d93aa5e9570d) fix: preserve inline `type` modifier in `no-useless-rename` autofix ([#&#8203;21527](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21527)) (sethamus)\n- [`af4c3a9`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/af4c3a9cc7c770419532b191ac465d4a1566eb0c) fix: preserve TypeScript type parameters in `prefer-arrow-callback` ([#&#8203;21507](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21507)) (L\u00ea V\u0103n Xu\u00e2n Ho\u00e0n)\n- [`b11bcb3`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/b11bcb3675871ebffbac2088f85650718f4cf481) fix: preserve necessary parens in `no-unneeded-ternary` autofix ([#&#8203;21495](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21495)) (L\u00ea V\u0103n Xu\u00e2n Ho\u00e0n)\n- [`7c7292e`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/7c7292ef4433c3291a5f2defefe3e1cfa32cc063) fix: require `minimatch@11.0.1` or higher to avoid CVE-2026-118764 ([#&#8203;21492](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21492)) (nikolawork)\n\n##### Documentation\n\n- [`16eb1d9`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/16eb1d9eff0352fc682f021fc9c9530ecb98c658) docs: remove Contributor Pool reference ([#&#8203;21539](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21539)) (Nicholas C. Zakas)\n- [`e368730`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/e36873082f0b565a68d3f8aa48a91a9aae34c2ac) docs: discourage non-serializable values in rule options ([#&#8203;21487](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21487)) (Vitalii Maslianok)\n- [`0146008`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/0146008d6e99aa31dc62153c200e714f5afdcd0e) docs: revamp code path analysis docs ([#&#8203;21423](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21423)) (xbinaryx)\n- [`aeb2267`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/aeb2267895923d02fa439e9ee8bc3c7fb61d939e) docs: revise AI acknowledgment options in templates ([#&#8203;21489](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21489)) (lumir)\n- [`e47a477`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/e47a47725b75f7aa08121b01ae4adf8e05324b6d) docs: Update README (GitHub Actions Bot)\n- [`11c66ba`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/11c66ba08381cb7cff7679d662c9f6654b6fe712) docs: fix typo in custom rules documentation ([#&#8203;21472](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21472)) (Pixel)\n\n##### Chores\n\n- [`480afad`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/480afad6e7efd034b687f69a07786f1e67c51816) chore: update github/codeql-action action to v4.39.3 ([#&#8203;21533](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21533)) (renovate\\[bot])\n- [`fc3a99b`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/fc3a99b198171db5454347bac502540a9ffb4128) chore: update ecosystem plugins ([#&#8203;21511](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21511)) (ESLint Bot)\n- [`8fe3ab9`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/8fe3ab9d9fb37595c6780839b1f3d02f30309b02) chore: replace `got` with Node.js native `fetch` ([#&#8203;21505](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21505)) (lumir)\n- [`bdd4b1d`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/bdd4b1da21dca81d50933edef0a015216059d877) ci: bump pnpm/action-setup from 6.1.0 to 6.1.1 ([#&#8203;21499](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21499)) (dependabot\\[bot])\n- [`36db635`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/36db63560d8d4243ba3dde654ceb12d8ae6359b5) ci: bump github/codeql-action from 4.39.1 to 4.39.2 ([#&#8203;21500](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21500)) (dependabot\\[bot])\n- [`19211b3`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/19211b32713d2b0d0fdb0b8c894d4e776597bf51) chore: replace `fs-teardown` with Node.js native APIs ([#&#8203;21488](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21488)) (lumir)\n- [`bbede5e`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/bbede5e5f2af8699098040548871bf135d50370e) chore: enforce `require-meta-docs-recommended` ([#&#8203;21496](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21496)) (lumir)\n- [`896b8ad`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/896b8ad4f260d060a1df1e6297f4d23b2999bb6f) chore: update ecosystem plugins ([#&#8203;21478](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21478)) (ESLint Bot)\n- [`35801a2`](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/commit/35801a2be2632d50d681c42f82b1091f7462746e) ci: re-enable `eslint-plugin-unicorn` ecosystem test ([#&#8203;21470](https://redirect.github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/21470)) (Francesco Trotta)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n\ud83d\udcc5 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n\ud83d\udea6 **Automerge**: Disabled by config. 